    <title>来点芝士EP.07: 企业为何偏爱用周末“假装重视学习”？【培训那伙事】</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/689b128020a2906a4d2d8dea</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">689b128020a2906a4d2d8dea</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 12 Aug 2025 10:30:19 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🧀对方正与你发起“芝士”共享。。。</span></p><span></span><p><span>您现在收听的是</span><strong><span>培训那伙事</span></strong><span>的快捷单元：</span><strong><span>来点芝士</span></strong><span>。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期话题： 《从奇瑞校招生风波看透：企业为何偏爱用周末“假装重视学习”？》</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🤔为什么要讨论这个话题？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>最近有一件热门的事件，奇瑞的一位校招生，由于不认同周六的培训和开会的安排，一怒之下邮件开大，抄送了全集团的高管。今天我们就借这个话题热点，从培训师的解读，来说说企业周末培训背后的真相。是不是培训师就那么喜欢在周末上课，职场人应该如何正确看待这件事。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期暴击观点】</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>💥 </span><strong><span>“周末培训是福利？不！企业并不重视培训。”</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><span>💥 </span><strong><span>领导舍不得工作日培训，潜台词是：“员工的成长不值我在工作日停产半天！”</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><span>💥 </span><strong><span>通知里培训是插播项，开会才是重点</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><span>💥 </span><strong><span>为学员创造一些可以让他们自由选择的小空间，一些可以被期待的小确幸</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><br></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>【延伸价值】</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>回听 Vol.</span><strong><span>06《培训中那些最难忘的学员》</span></strong><span>&nbsp;</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>本期主播：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>l 👧🏻Zhu老师：在医疗行业深耕多年的企业内训师</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>📒要点快进Show notes:</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;正片开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="46">00:46</a> &nbsp;热点事件复盘：周六培训暴露企业培训的哪些问题？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="81">01:21</a> &nbsp;深度剖析：企业执着周末培训的2大真相</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="221">03:41</a> &nbsp;职场人自救指南：如何应对周末培训？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="369">06:09</a> &nbsp;感谢收听</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>❤️哪里能听到本节目：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>苹果播客/小宇宙/喜马拉雅/ QQ音乐/VX听一听 /</span></p><span></span><p><u><span>搜索：培训那伙事</span></u></p><span></span><p><span>感谢收听！欢迎订阅！</span></p>]]></description>
