  <item>
    <title>【周年特别节目】虽然没有大火，但依旧热爱：聊聊创作初心与幕后故事</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6838825b38dcc57c64a764ad</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6838825b38dcc57c64a764ad</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 30 May 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🎙️培训那回事，不是一个人的事</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎来到播客节目！培训那伙事</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期主题：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>【周年特别节目】虽然没有大火，但依旧热爱：聊聊创作初心与幕后故事</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎤本期主播：</span></strong><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>👧🏻Zhu老师：在医疗行业深耕多年的企业内训师</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>核心主题</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>节目开播一周年回顾：创作动机、幕后故事、挑战收获，以及对未来的展望。</span></p><span></span><p><span>📒</span><strong><span>要点快进Show notes:</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a> &nbsp;正片开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="117">01:57</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;为什么叫“培训那伙事”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="178">02:58</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;主播自己最喜欢哪期节目？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="263">04:23</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;在什么契机下开始做播客的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="399">06:39</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;话题亮点播报的片头设计是怎么来的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="492">08:12</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;做播客的过程中，有什么发现和收获？”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;有什么困难和挑战？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="725">12:05</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;新的一个周期，有什么展望？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="804">13:24</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;感谢听众一年陪伴！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>节目亮点摘要</span></strong></p><span></span><ol><span>  </span><li><strong><span>周年里程碑</span></strong><span>    </span><ul><span>      </span><li><span>开播1年，发布11期访谈+5期知识快闪</span></li><span>      </span><li><span>订阅量420+，播放量近2000次</span></li><span>      </span><li><strong><span>金句</span></strong><span>： </span><em><span>“虽然没有大火，但这点成绩我已经很满意！”</span></em></li><span>    </span></ul><span>  </span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>节目名称的深意</span></strong><span>    </span><ul><span>      </span><li><span>“培训那</span><strong><span>伙</span></strong><span>事”三重含义：</span><br><span> ✅ </span><strong><span>伙伴</span></strong><span>（连接同行者）</span><br><span> ✅ </span><strong><span>团伙</span></strong><span>（群体智慧碰撞）</span><br><span> ✅ </span><strong><span>大火</span></strong><span>（对影响力的期待）</span></li><span>      </span><li><strong><span>Slogan</span></strong><span>： </span><em><span>“培训那回事，不是一个人的事”</span></em></li><span>    </span></ul><span>  </span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>主理人私心推荐单集</span></strong><span>    </span><ul><span>      </span><li><strong><span>Vol.7</span></strong><span>《学习项目管理的取经之路》</span></li><span>      </span><li><strong><span>Vol.8</span></strong><span>《引导团队智慧的催化剂》</span></li><span>      </span><li><span>推荐理由：制作技术成熟、嘉宾深度、内容常听常新。</span></li><span>    </span></ul><span>  </span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>创作契机</span></strong><span>    </span><ul><span>      </span><li><span>职业迷茫期探索新方向</span></li><span>      </span><li><span>用播客打破对企业内训师的刻板印象</span></li><span>      </span><li><strong><span>洞察</span></strong><span>： </span><em><span>“培训绝非只是讲课，更是台下十年功的系统工程。”</span></em></li><span>    </span></ul><span>  </span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>特色环节设计</span></strong><span>    </span><ul><span>      </span><li><strong><span>话题亮点片头</span></strong><span>：致敬播客鼻祖《冬吴相对论》（梁冬&amp;吴伯凡）</span></li><span>    </span></ul><span>  </span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>幕后真实发现</span></strong><span>    </span><ul><span>      </span><li><strong><span>表达的艺术</span></strong><span>：剪辑时暴露自己“啰嗦”（口头禅：“就是啊”“其实上啊”）</span></li><span>      </span><li><strong><span>表达欲的觉醒</span></strong><span>： </span><em><span>“每位嘉宾都有强烈分享欲，缺的只是表达舞台。”</span></em></li><span>    </span></ul><span>  </span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>最大挑战</span></strong><span>    </span><ul><span>      </span><li><strong><span>诚挚呼吁</span></strong><span>：听众推荐话题/自荐当嘉宾 ➡️ 联系方式见节目详情页！</span></li><span>    </span></ul><span>  </span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>未来展望</span></strong><span>    </span><ul><span>      </span><li><strong><span>务实目标</span></strong><span>：坚持更新，一期一期做下去</span></li><span>      </span><li><strong><span>核心价值</span></strong><span>：为培训从业者提供启发，帮圈外人破除认知壁垒</span></li><span>    </span></ul><span>  </span></li><span></span></ol><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmN8WIVNwmERLpCTDkln3q6CLEjW.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>❤️哪里能听到本节目：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>苹果播客/小宇宙/喜马拉雅/ QQ音乐/VX听一听 /</span></p><span></span><p><u><span>搜索：培训那伙事</span></u></p><span></span><p><span>感谢收听！欢迎订阅！</span></p>]]></description>
